### 1. Create Post with Thumbnail
POST http://localhost:8000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Bài viết có thumbnail
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Đây là nội dung bài viết test với thumbnail
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="thumbnail"; filename="image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 2. Create Post without Thumbnail
POST http://localhost:8000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bài viết không có thumbnail",
  "content": "Đây là nội dung bài viết không có thumbnail"
}

###

### 3. Get All Posts
GET http://localhost:8000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 4. Get Single Post
GET http://localhost:8000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 5. Update Post with New Thumbnail
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Bài viết đã cập nhật
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Nội dung đã được cập nhật
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="thumbnail"; filename="new-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/your/new-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 6. Update Post without changing Thumbnail
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bài viết cập nhật không đổi thumbnail",
  "content": "Chỉ cập nhật title và content"
}

###

### 7. Delete Post (and its thumbnail)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### 8. Test Validation - Invalid File Type
POST http://localhost:8000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test validation
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Test content
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="thumbnail"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/document.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

# Expected: 422 Validation Error

###

### 9. Test Validation - File Too Large (>2MB)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test large file
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Test content
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="thumbnail"; filename="large-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/large-image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

# Expected: 422 Validation Error

